{
  "Npcs.BoneCourtier.Desc": "Before you stands a human skeleton dressed in tattered nobleman's clothing and a regal cap. Although it has suffered the ravages of time, you can guess that this human was quite respected when he still lived. It carries a darkened copper goblet and a scroll covered with unreadable runes."
  "Npcs.BoneCourtier.Name": "Bone Sorcerer"
}
